    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan does not know its Immortal Gu recipe and cannot recreate it. Refining it and white noodle queen ant took resources from Fire Plain grotto-heaven that would normally be sufficient to refine more than ten rank seven Immortal Gu. Fang Yuan reasons that, given enough resources, lingering poisonous ant plague could still produce slight variants of this Gu, such as a red copper water ant or a yellow gold fire ant.",
